WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.051 --> 00:00:14.271
Roxy called to her friends.

2
00:00:15.332 --> 00:00:16.533
They were farther up the trail.

3
00:00:16.553 --> 00:00:18.654
"I'll be back in a minute!

4
00:00:19.214 --> 00:00:20.935
I still can't find my water bottle!"

5
00:00:20.955 --> 00:00:24.097
"Wait!" Terrell called back.

6
00:00:24.518 --> 00:00:28.080
"We can help—" Before Terrell could finish, Roxy ran off.

7
00:00:30.812 --> 00:00:32.614
A moment later she shot through the sky.

8
00:00:32.634 --> 00:00:36.477
"Whoa!" Mara cried.

9
00:00:36.497 --> 00:00:38.319
"Rocket Girl!"

10
00:00:39.259 --> 00:00:40.200
Terrell shook his head.

11
00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:44.083
"Roxy is never around when we see Rocket Girl."

12
00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.507
Roxy arrived at True Savings Bank.

13
00:00:49.168 --> 00:00:50.709
Police cars were parked in front.

14
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:54.913
Inside, Detective Smith was standing behind the counter.

15
00:00:54.933 --> 00:00:58.696
"Hello, sir," Roxy said.

16
00:00:59.448 --> 00:01:01.189
"I'd like to open a bank account."

17
00:01:02.049 --> 00:01:03.169
Detective Smith frowned.

18
00:01:03.189 --> 00:01:05.810
"Very funny, Rocket Girl.

19
00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:07.791
But we have a crime to solve.

20
00:01:08.451 --> 00:01:09.911
This bank was robbed."

21
00:01:09.931 --> 00:01:12.512
"I know," Roxy said.

22
00:01:12.532 --> 00:01:14.472
"Do you know who the robber is?"

23
00:01:15.613 --> 00:01:16.893
Detective Smith shook his head.

24
00:01:16.913 --> 00:01:19.354
"I just got here a moment ago.

25
00:01:20.014 --> 00:01:21.094
I'm looking for clues."

26
00:01:22.895 --> 00:01:24.615
"It wasn't just one robber."

27
00:01:25.356 --> 00:01:26.636
A security guard stomped over.

28
00:01:28.108 --> 00:01:29.769
"There was a whole group of them.

29
00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:33.752
They were horrible—dirty and smelly and mean!"

30
00:01:34.733 --> 00:01:37.134
Detective Smith took his small notebook from his pocket.

31
00:01:37.154 --> 00:01:39.656
"Can you describe what they looked like?"

32
00:01:40.536 --> 00:01:41.617
The security guard nodded.

33
00:01:41.637 --> 00:01:47.101
"The boss wore a large hat and has a hook for a hand.

34
00:01:48.362 --> 00:01:50.043
A parrot was sitting on her shoulder.

35
00:01:51.003 --> 00:01:53.025
It kept saying 'Yo-ho-ho!'"

36
00:01:54.206 --> 00:01:55.667
Detective Smith raised an eyebrow.

37
00:01:58.412 --> 00:02:00.453
"Yo-ho-ho?" "That's right," the security guard said.

38
00:02:00.473 --> 00:02:06.354
"Yo-ho-ho." "What did the other robbers look like?"

39
00:02:06.614 --> 00:02:07.314
Roxy asked.

40
00:02:08.435 --> 00:02:09.995
The security guard rubbed his chin.

41
00:02:10.015 --> 00:02:12.636
"There were three other robbers.

42
00:02:13.996 --> 00:02:15.977
One had a long beard and an eye patch.

43
00:02:16.917 --> 00:02:18.557
The other two wore bandannas.

44
00:02:19.738 --> 00:02:20.978
One guy had a wooden leg."

45
00:02:20.998 --> 00:02:24.479
"It sounds like they're pirates!"

46
00:02:24.799 --> 00:02:25.419
Roxy said.

47
00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:27.640
Detective Smith scratched his head.

48
00:02:28.852 --> 00:02:31.113
"There aren't any pirates in Metro City.

49
00:02:32.093 --> 00:02:33.713
They must be from out of town."

50
00:02:34.814 --> 00:02:38.555
"We have to stop them before they rob another bank," Roxy said.

51
00:02:39.475 --> 00:02:41.395
Just then Detective Smith's phone beeped.

52
00:02:41.415 --> 00:02:45.577
"Hello? Oh no!

53
00:02:46.177 --> 00:02:47.897
Okay, we'll hurry over there right now!"

54
00:02:47.917 --> 00:02:49.738
"What's going on?"

55
00:02:49.998 --> 00:02:50.618
Roxy asked.

56
00:02:50.638 --> 00:02:52.959
"Are the pirates robbing another bank?"

57
00:02:54.339 --> 00:02:55.899
"Nope," Detective Smith said.

58
00:02:55.919 --> 00:02:57.640
"They're eating lunch."

59
00:03:00.532 --> 00:03:02.253
"Huh?" Roxy was confused.

60
00:03:02.273 --> 00:03:04.873
"The pirates are at The Wharf.

61
00:03:05.493 --> 00:03:09.114
That's the city's fanciest seafood restaurant," Detective Smith said.

62
00:03:10.035 --> 00:03:12.155
"The owner said they're causing lots of trouble.

63
00:03:12.875 --> 00:03:16.656
They are making a mess, breaking things, and scaring the other customers."

64
00:03:17.977 --> 00:03:19.157
Roxy folded her arms.

65
00:03:19.797 --> 00:03:21.158
"We have to catch them!"

66
00:03:21.798 --> 00:03:23.318
Detective Smith put away his phone.

67
00:03:24.439 --> 00:03:25.379
"Okay, Rocket Girl.

68
00:03:25.539 --> 00:03:27.339
Let's—Rocket Girl?"
